{"title":"《住房城乡建设领域公共信用信息目录（2025年版）》发布","date":"2025-10-28","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<strong>《住房城乡建设领域公共信用信息目录（2025年版）》发布</strong></h1>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-style-id=\"27846\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:50px;height:40px;border-top:2px solid #2780ff;border-left:2px solid #2780ff;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(to top, #2780ff, #f3f3f7);width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:50%;margin-left:auto;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;transform:rotateZ(0deg);-webkit-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-moz-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-ms-transform:rotateZ(0deg);-o-transform:rotateZ(0deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top:-33px;margin-left:7px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:#f4fbff;padding:15px;margin-right:7px;color:#436281;margin-bottom:unset;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;line-height:1.75em;font-size:17px;\">为贯彻落实党中央、国务院关于推进社会信用体系建设高质量发展的决策部署，规范住房城乡建设领域公共信用信息归集范围，根据《全国公共信用信息基础目录（2025年版）》，结合住房城乡建设工作实际，住房城乡建设部编制并印发了《住房城乡建设领域公共信用信息目录（2025年版）》，自2025年10月20日起实施。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top:-32px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%;height:40px;border-bottom:2px solid #2780ff;border-right:2px solid #2780ff;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"67042\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:5em;margin:0px auto;z-index:1000;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top:12px;background-image:linear-gradient(#07B5ED,#0374ED);border-radius:11px;padding:8px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:#fefefe;border-radius:11px;padding:17px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 2;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>住房城乡建设部办公厅关于印发</strong><br />\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>住房城乡建设领域公共信用信息</strong><br />\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>目录（2025年版）的通知</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;line-height:1.75em;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">各省、自治区住房城乡建设厅，直辖市住房城乡建设（管）委及有关部门，新疆生产建设兵团住房城乡建设局，部机关各单位、直属有关单位：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">为贯彻落实党中央、国务院关于推进社会信用体系建设高质量发展的决策部署，规范住房城乡建设领域公共信用信息归集范围，根据《全国公共信用信息基础目录（2025年版）》，结合住房城乡建设工作实际，我部编制了《住房城乡建设领域公共信用信息目录（2025年版）》，现予以印发。本通知自印发之日起实施，上一版同时废止。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:right;line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">住房城乡建设部办公厅</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:right;line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">2025年10月20日</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">（此件主动公开）</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-h